3. offers the same or substantially similar functionality as the Software.

Permitted Purposes are limited to the following uses:

1. personal use, meaning use by an individual for their own purposes, not on
   behalf of an organization and not for commercial advantage or monetary
   compensation;

2. family use, meaning personal use by an individual for themselves and the
   members of their family or household;

3. nonprofit use, meaning a nonprofit organization's own noncommercial use;
   and

4. classroom use, meaning teaching and learning at schools or in courses.

Permitted Purposes include self-hosted deployments, including forks you modify
and redeploy on infrastructure you control (for example, your own Cloudflare
account).

Any other use on behalf of an organization, or any commercial use, requires a
license from the Licensor. To request one, email support@kody.codes.

